=2 Walkthrough
* Easily soloable mission.
* After confirming the mission with {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, go to a Windurstian controlled {p:Campaign} area **in the Northlands** and talk to the {p:Gate Sentry}. The Gate Sentry will either tell you:
** "These are the supplies you are to deliver to the stronghold of this area. Some of the items are very delicate and will be destroyed if you are not careful. Avoid all confrontation with the enemy." You will then receive {@k}{k:Campaign supplies} immediately.
** or that "the supply unit carrying rations and munitions to our stronghold in this area was attacked en route, and forced to abandon the cargo. You are to locate the supplies and deliver them to their final destination."
*** This means you must examine a ??? to obtain the supplies.
** Either way, deliver the supplies to the stronghold of the area without getting aggro.
*** You **__can**__ mount to deliver the supplies.

=3 List of Gate Sentries
* {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}: G-6
* {z:Xarcabard (S)}: J-9

=3 List of Campaign NPCs
* {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)}: I-8
* {z:Xarcabard (S)}: H-8 ({n:Yimi Jomkeh, M.C.})

=3 List of ??? Supply Positions
* {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} (H-9)
* {z:Xarcabard (S)}: (H-7)/(H-8) (Near a rock spire inside a circle of smaller rocks, by the skeletons, right on the border line of the two grid squares, almost straight north from the Campaign NPC)

* Once you've arrived at the Campaign NPC, talk to them and you will be told to report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* After talking to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, the mission is complete.

